Package: DataFindR
Title: LLM-Assisted Screening and Data Extraction for Living Systematic Reviews
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Anders Hagen", "Jarmund", , "anders.h.jarmund@ntnu.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3923-1637"))
Description: Uses large language models (via 'ellmer') to screen studies by
    title and abstract and to extract structured data from full texts into a
    'metawoRld' project. Fetches metadata from PubMed and Crossref, caches all
    results with their provenance inside the project, supports parallel and
    discounted batch requests, and includes 'shiny' apps for human review.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/andjar/DataFindR
